// HTH 3.3: Managed browser extension lifecycle
// Profile: L2 (Walk); NIST 800-53 CM-7, SI-4
// Guide: https://howtoharden.com/guides/microsoft-intune/#33
// Native ExtensionSettings value. Merge into existing managed policy after review.
// Intentionally blocks all extensions until approved per-ID entries are added.
// Repeat blocked_permissions/runtime_blocked_hosts in each per-ID exception.
// Replace the example host with your actual sensitive admin domains.
// HTH Guide Excerpt: begin extension-policy
{
  "*": {
    "installation_mode": "blocked",
    "blocked_permissions": ["nativeMessaging", "debugger"],
    "runtime_blocked_hosts": ["*://*.admin.example.com"]
  }
}
// HTH Guide Excerpt: end extension-policy
